! RECMACRO: record the commands the user issues into a macro.
! RECMACRO 1 starts; RECMACRO 0 file stops and saves (macro folder when the
! name has no directory, .zoa added); bare RECMACRO reports the status;
! RECMACRO 0 with no file is a GUI save dialog, an error headless.
! Only top-level commands are recorded: Zoa's own redraw / reference-ray
! work and the lines of a running macro or lens file are not.
RECMACRO
RECMACRO 0 nothing
RECMACRO 1
RECMACRO 1
RES osdtriplet
THI S6 40
RDY S1 16
VIE
GO
RECMACRO
RECMACRO 0
RECMACRO 0 recTest
RECMACRO
RECMACRO 2
PRT zoa_macro:recTest
! Replaying it on the original lens reproduces the edits.
RES osdtriplet
SUR SA
RES macro:recTest
SUR SA
